* ============================================================================
* 01_data_prep.do — Load panel + xtset + globals (bank_fintech_locus / P4)
* Paper: {{PAPER_ID}}
* RR6-1: paper-specific globals + P4 primary_pair derivation (R35-M02)
* ============================================================================

version 19
clear all
set more off

if "$data_dir" == ""  global data_dir "../data"
if "$panel_dta" == "" global panel_dta "$data_dir/40_panel_yearly.dta"

use "$panel_dta", clear

capture confirm variable bank_id
if _rc encode target_bank, gen(bank_id)
xtset bank_id year

global controls "{{CONTROLS}}"
* $bank_controls 保留为 $controls 的兼容性 alias (部分 robustness 模板引用)
global bank_controls "$controls"

* P4 required variables: outcome + panel-level locus 占比 (tech_frac/app_frac)。
* 注: innovation_locus 是 article-level 中文类别 (底层技术/应用场景), stage 45 聚合为
* bank-year 的 tech_frac (底层技术占比) / app_frac (应用场景占比); 故 panel 级以
* tech_frac/app_frac 为源, 而非 article-level 的 innovation_locus_full (不在 bank-year panel)。
foreach v in {{MAIN_DV}} tech_frac app_frac {
    capture confirm variable `v'
    if _rc {
        display as error "[ERROR] required P4 variable `v' missing — run M0.5.11 enrichment + stage 21 (tone_llms) locus classification + stage 45 panel aggregation first"
        exit 198
    }
}

* R35-M02: derive firm-year primary_pair (locus_layer_full, locus_scenario_full) from
* panel-level locus 占比, 以"主导类别"二元化 (Gomber 2018 JMIS layer-vs-scenario):
* bank-year 若 底层占比 > 应用占比 → layer-focused; 反之 → scenario-focused;
* 平局 (tech_frac == app_frac, 含两者皆 0) 两者皆 0, 作参照组 (避免与常数项共线)。
capture drop locus_layer_full locus_scenario_full locus_gap
gen locus_layer_full    = (tech_frac > app_frac) if !missing(tech_frac, app_frac)
gen locus_scenario_full = (app_frac > tech_frac) if !missing(tech_frac, app_frac)
gen locus_gap = locus_layer_full - locus_scenario_full   // ∈ {-1, 0, +1}

* Winsorize outcome
capture which winsor2
if !_rc winsor2 {{MAIN_DV}}, cuts(1 99) suffix(_w)
else gen {{MAIN_DV}}_w = {{MAIN_DV}}

save "$data_dir/_prepared_panel.dta", replace
display "[OK] P4 data prep N=" _N "; locus_layer / locus_scenario derived from tech_frac/app_frac (bank-year 主导类别)"
